              "description": "An unshaded circle with a horizontal tangent PQ at its bottom point P. External point Q is to the right. Secant Q–R–S enters at lower-right R and exits at upper-left S. Ordinary source colours are replaced by house black.",
              "mathematics": "PQ is tangent at P; Q, R and S are collinear in that order. QR is the external segment and QS is the whole secant. The schematic coordinates carry no additional numerical givens.",
